{%- liquid
  comment
    THE PRINT OPTION IS A REAL VARIANT OPTION, NOT A CHECKBOX.

    A shirt with a number on the back costs four euro more, and in Shopify the
    only thing that can make a line cost more is the variant. Line item
    properties — which is what the name and the number themselves are — carry
    text and never touch the price, so a surcharge built out of them would be
    a figure on the page that the checkout disagrees with.

    So the shop keeps an ordinary product option (default name "Veredelung",
    values "Ohne" and "Mit Druck") on the articles that offer printing, and
    the dearer variants are simply priced four euro higher. Everything below
    is presentation: the option is lifted out of the plain variant picker and
    presented as the choice it actually is, with the fields for what gets
    printed and where.

    A product without that option renders exactly as before, which is what
    makes this per-article without anybody maintaining a list.
  endcomment

  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign product_form_id = 'ProductForm-' | append: section.id

  assign print_option_name = ''
  assign print_value_without = ''
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'personalisation'
      assign print_option_name = block.settings.option_name | strip | downcase
      assign print_value_without = block.settings.value_without | strip | downcase
    endif
  endfor

  assign print_option_index = -1
  assign print_value_off = ''
  assign print_value_on = ''
  if print_option_name != blank
    for option in product.options_with_values
      assign option_name = option.name | strip | downcase
      if option_name == print_option_name
        assign print_option_index = forloop.index0
        for value in option.values
          assign value_key = value | strip | downcase
          if value_key == print_value_without
            assign print_value_off = value
          elsif print_value_on == blank
            assign print_value_on = value
          endif
        endfor
        comment
          Nothing matched the configured "without" value, so fall back to the
          order the option was written in: first value off, second value on.
          A club that names them "Nein" and "Ja" still gets a working block
          rather than a silent nothing.
        endcomment
        if print_value_off == blank
          assign print_value_off = option.values.first
          assign print_value_on = ''
          for value in option.values
            unless forloop.first
              if print_value_on == blank
                assign print_value_on = value
              endif
            endunless
          endfor
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    What the printing costs, read off the variants instead of typed into a
    setting: raise the price in Shopify and the figure on the page follows.
  endcomment
  assign print_surcharge = 0
  if print_option_index >= 0 and print_value_on != blank
    assign price_off = 2147483647
    assign price_on = 2147483647
    for variant in product.variants
      assign variant_value = variant.options[print_option_index]
      if variant_value == print_value_off
        if variant.price < price_off
          assign price_off = variant.price
        endif
      elsif variant_value == print_value_on
        if variant.price < price_on
          assign price_on = variant.price
        endif
      endif
    endfor
    if price_off < 2147483647 and price_on < 2147483647 and price_on > price_off
      assign print_surcharge = price_on | minus: price_off
    endif
  endif
-%}
<section class="main-product section-shell page-width" data-product-root>
  <div class="product-gallery reveal">
    {%- if product.media.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="product-gallery__stage">
        {%- for media in product.media -%}
          <div class="product-media{% unless forloop.first %} product-media--secondary{% endunless %}" data-media-id="{{ media.id }}">
            {%- case media.media_type -%}
              {%- when 'image' -%}
                {%- if forloop.first -%}
                  {{ media | image_url: width: 1800 | image_tag: widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1800', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 58vw, 100vw', loading: 'eager', alt: media.alt }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{ media | image_url: width: 1800 | image_tag: widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1800', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 58vw, 100vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: media.alt }}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- when 'video' -%}{{ media | video_tag: controls: true, preload: 'metadata' }}
              {%- when 'external_video' -%}{{ media | external_video_tag }}
              {%- when 'model' -%}{{ media | model_viewer_tag }}
            {%- endcase -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="product-gallery__stage product-placeholder">{{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="product-info reveal">
    <div class="product-info__sticky">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}
          {%- when '@app' -%}{% render block %}
          {%- when 'vendor' -%}<p class="eyebrow eyebrow--red" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ product.vendor }}</p>
          {%- when 'title' -%}<h1 {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
          {%- when 'price' -%}<div {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{% render 'price', product: product %}</div>
          {%- when 'variant_picker' -%}
            {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
              <variant-selects class="variant-selects" data-section="{{ section.id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
                  {%- if forloop.index0 == print_option_index -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <label for="Option-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}">{{ option.name }}</label>
                  <select id="Option-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}" data-option-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                    {%- for value in option.values -%}<option value="{{ value | escape }}"{% if option.selected_value == value %} selected{% endif %}>{{ value }}</option>{%- endfor -%}
                  </select>
                {%- endfor -%}
                <script type="application/json">{{ product.variants | json }}</script>
              </variant-selects>
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- when 'quantity' -%}
            <div class="quantity-wrap" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <label for="Quantity-{{ section.id }}">{{ 'products.product.quantity' | t }}</label>
              <div class="quantity"><button type="button" data-quantity-minus aria-label="Anzahl verringern">−</button><input id="Quantity-{{ section.id }}" type="number" name="quantity" min="1" value="1" form="{{ product_form_id }}"><button type="button" data-quantity-plus aria-label="Anzahl erhöhen">+</button></div>
            </div>
          {%- when 'buy_buttons' -%}
            <div class="buy-buttons" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {% form 'product', product, id: product_form_id, class: 'product-form' %}
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}" data-variant-id>
                <button class="button button--red button--wide" type="submit" name="add"{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %} data-add-to-cart>
                  <span>{% if current_variant.available %}{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}{% else %}{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}{% endif %}</span><b>→</b>
                </button>
                {%- if block.settings.show_dynamic_checkout -%}{{ form | payment_button }}{%- endif -%}
              {% endform %}
            </div>
          {%- when 'personalisation' -%}
            {%- if print_option_index >= 0 and print_value_on != blank -%}
              <div class="personalise" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                   data-personalise
                   data-value-off="{{ print_value_off | escape }}"
                   data-value-on="{{ print_value_on | escape }}">
                <div class="personalise__head">
                  <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--red">{{ block.settings.heading }}</span>
                  {%- if print_surcharge > 0 -%}<span class="personalise__price">+{{ print_surcharge | money }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                </div>
                {%- if block.settings.note != blank -%}<p class="personalise__note">{{ block.settings.note }}</p>{%- endif -%}

                {%- comment -%}
                  This is the print option, hidden, and it is what actually
                  decides the variant and therefore the price. The radios
                  below only set it.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                <input type="hidden" data-option-index="{{ print_option_index }}" data-personalise-option value="{{ print_value_off | escape }}">

                <div class="personalise__kinds" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}">
                  {%- assign kinds = 'off|Ohne,number|Nummer,initials|Initialen,position|Position' | split: ',' -%}
                  {%- for kind in kinds -%}
                    {%- assign parts = kind | split: '|' -%}
                    <label class="personalise__kind">
                      <input type="radio" name="Personalise-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ parts.first }}" data-personalise-kind{% if forloop.first %} checked{% endif %}>
                      <span>{{ parts.last }}</span>
                    </label>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>

                <div class="personalise__fields" data-personalise-fields hidden>
                  <label class="personalise__field" data-personalise-field="number" hidden>
                    <span>{{ block.settings.label_number }}</span>
                    <input type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" maxlength="2" placeholder="{{ block.settings.placeholder_number | escape }}" data-personalise-value disabled>
                  </label>
                  <label class="personalise__field" data-personalise-field="initials" hidden>
                    <span>{{ block.settings.label_initials }}</span>
                    <input type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="4" placeholder="{{ block.settings.placeholder_initials | escape }}" data-personalise-value disabled>
                  </label>
                  <label class="personalise__field" data-personalise-field="position" hidden>
                    <span>{{ block.settings.label_position }}</span>
                    <select data-personalise-value disabled>
                      {%- assign positions = block.settings.positions | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
                      {%- for position in positions -%}
                        {%- assign position_value = position | strip -%}
                        {%- if position_value != blank -%}<option value="{{ position_value | escape }}">{{ position_value }}</option>{%- endif -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="personalise__field" data-personalise-field="placement" hidden>
                    <span>{{ block.settings.label_placement }}</span>
                    <select data-personalise-placement disabled>
                      {%- assign placements = block.settings.placements | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
                      {%- for placement in placements -%}
                        {%- assign placement_value = placement | strip -%}
                        {%- if placement_value != blank -%}<option value="{{ placement_value | escape }}">{{ placement_value }}</option>{%- endif -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <p class="personalise__preview" data-personalise-preview aria-live="polite"></p>
                  <p class="personalise__error" data-personalise-error role="alert" hidden></p>
                </div>

                {%- comment -%}
                  What is printed travels as line item properties: they reach
                  the order and the packing slip, which is where whoever does
                  the printing will read them.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[Veredelung]" form="{{ product_form_id }}" data-personalise-prop="kind" disabled>
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[Aufdruck]" form="{{ product_form_id }}" data-personalise-prop="value" disabled>
                <input type="hidden" name="properties[Platzierung]" form="{{ product_form_id }}" data-personalise-prop="placement" disabled>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- when 'description' -%}<div class="product-description rte" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ product.description }}</div>
          {%- when 'custom_liquid' -%}<div class="rte" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.custom_liquid }}</div>
          {%- when 'trust' -%}<div class="trust-row" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><span>✓ SICHERE ZAHLUNG</span><span>↗ SCHNELLER VERSAND</span><span>★ TEAM OFFICIAL</span></div>
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product information",
  "settings": [],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "@app" },
    { "type": "vendor", "name": "Anbieter", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "title", "name": "Heading", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "price", "name": "Preis", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "variant_picker", "name": "Variantenauswahl", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "quantity", "name": "Anzahl", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "buy_buttons", "name": "Kaufbuttons", "limit": 1, "settings": [{ "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_dynamic_checkout", "label": "Dynamischen Checkout anzeigen", "default": true }] },
    {"type": "personalisation", "name": "Veredelung (Nummer / Initialen / Position)", "limit": 1, "settings": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": "Erscheint nur bei Artikeln, die eine Produktoption mit dem unten eingetragenen Namen haben (z. B. „Veredelung“ mit den Werten „Ohne“ und „Mit Druck“). Der Aufpreis kommt aus dem Preisunterschied dieser Varianten — hier wird nichts eingetragen."}, {"type": "text", "id": "option_name", "label": "Name der Produktoption", "default": "Veredelung"}, {"type": "text", "id": "value_without", "label": "Wert für „ohne Druck“", "default": "Ohne"}, {"type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Überschrift", "default": "Veredelung"}, {"type": "text", "id": "note", "label": "Hinweis", "default": "Nummer, Initialen oder Position — dein Name auf dem Trikot."}, {"type": "text", "id": "label_number", "label": "Beschriftung: Nummer", "default": "Nummer"}, {"type": "text", "id": "placeholder_number", "label": "Platzhalter: Nummer", "default": "z. B. 89"}, {"type": "text", "id": "label_initials", "label": "Beschriftung: Initialen", "default": "Initialen"}, {"type": "text", "id": "placeholder_initials", "label": "Platzhalter: Initialen", "default": "z. B. CG"}, {"type": "text", "id": "label_position", "label": "Beschriftung: Position", "default": "Position"}, {"type": "textarea", "id": "positions", "label": "Positionen (eine pro Zeile)", "default": "QB\nRB\nFB\nWR\nTE\nOL\nC\nG\nT\nDL\nDE\nDT\nNT\nLB\nMLB\nILB\nOLB\nCB\nDB\nFS\nSS\nK\nP\nLS"}, {"type": "text", "id": "label_placement", "label": "Beschriftung: Platzierung", "default": "Platzierung"}, {"type": "textarea", "id": "placements", "label": "Platzierungen (eine pro Zeile)", "default": "Brust links\nBrust rechts\nÄrmel links\nÄrmel rechts\nNacken\nRücken groß"}]},
    { "type": "description", "name": "Produktbeschreibung", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "trust", "name": "Vertrauenspunkte", "limit": 1 },
    { "type": "custom_liquid", "name": "Custom Liquid", "settings": [{ "type": "liquid", "id": "custom_liquid", "label": "Custom Liquid" }] }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
